{"unit_id":"tag:03N3:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n这些讲义讨论另一种上同调（cohomology）理论（theory）。首先要指出的是，Zariski 拓扑（topology）并不完全令人满意。它未能给出我们期望的结果的主要原因之一是，若<MATH_0001>是复（complex）代数簇（variety），而<MATH_0002>是常值（constant）层（sheaf），则\n<MATHSEG_0001> 对所有 <MATHSEG_0002>\n其原因如下。在不可约（irreducible）概形（scheme）中（特别是在代数簇（variety）中），任意两个非空开（nonempty open）子集（subsets）都有交，因而常值（constant）层（sheaf）的限制映射（restriction mappings）是满射（surjective）。我们称该层（sheaf）是<TEXTITOPEN_0001>松弛（flasque）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>的。在这种情况下，所有高阶（higher）<GROUPOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001><GROUPCLOSE_0001>ech 上同调群（cohomology groups）都消失，所有高阶（higher）Zariski 上同调群（cohomology groups）也都消失。换言之，Zariski 拓扑（topology）中的开（open）集（sets）“不够多”，无法检测这种高阶（higher）上同调（cohomology）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n另一方面，若<MATH_0003>是光滑（smooth）的射影（projective）复（complex）代数簇（variety），则\n<MATHSEG_0003> 对于 <MATHSEG_0004>\n其中<MATH_0004>所表示的集合（set）由<MATH_0005>的复（complex）点（points）组成。若能在代数几何（algebraic geometry）中再现这一特征，就会很理想。特别是在正特征（positive characteristic）下。\n\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":["Zariski","ech"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"theory","target_term":"理论"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复"},{"source_term":"variety","target_term":"代数簇"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"常值"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"irreducible","target_term":"不可约"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"variety","target_term":"代数簇"},{"source_term":"nonempty open","target_term":"非空开"},{"source_term":"subsets","target_term":"子集"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"常值"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"restriction mappings","target_term":"限制映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"flasque","target_term":"松弛"},{"source_term":"higher","target_term":"高阶"},{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群"},{"source_term":"higher","target_term":"高阶"},{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集"},{"source_term":"higher","target_term":"高阶"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"projective","target_term":"射影"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复"},{"source_term":"variety","target_term":"代数簇"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"algebraic geometry","target_term":"代数几何"},{"source_term":"positive characteristic","target_term":"正特征"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"讲义讨论的上同调；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"theory","target_term":"理论","context":"上同调理论；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"Zariski拓扑；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复","context":"复代数簇及复点；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"variety","target_term":"代数簇","context":"原文variety；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"常值","context":"常值层；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"原文sheaf；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"irreducible","target_term":"不可约","context":"不可约概形；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"原文scheme；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"nonempty open","target_term":"非空开","context":"非空开子集；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"subsets","target_term":"子集","context":"相交的子集；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"restriction mappings","target_term":"限制映射","context":"常值层的限制映射；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"限制映射为满射；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"flasque","target_term":"松弛","context":"层的flasque性质；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"higher","target_term":"高阶","context":"高阶上同调及其群；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群","context":"Čech与Zariski上同调群；词表尚未批准。"},{"source_term":"open","target